  "snapshotNotes": [
    "sessionId and planVersion (initially 1) included. ownRevision starts at0, including imported creator execution.",
    "completion contains persisted participant status active|finalizing|saved|finished_empty and own nullable historyId; finish/leave responses map finalizing to pending.",
    "execution.everAcknowledged is server-owned identity lock, retained after removing all sets. Input schemas do not accept it as authority.",
    "hostId is null after host account purge; surviving athletes retain own recovery. Observed expiry, paid loss, block or leave permanently closes collaboration for this session.",
    "Participant exerciseCatalog contains authorized frozen name/category/primaryMuscles keyed by source exerciseId. Foreign custom exercises are saved as stable private per-athlete copies; missing own/system sources use their frozen definition. Internal source-to-history exercise mappings persist transactionally. Recovery copies may appear in the athlete custom catalog."
  ],
  "validationNotes": [
    "weightKg finite 0..9999.99 (existing recording numeric precision); reps integer0..10000; max100 exercises and100sets per exercise.",
    "Every mutation uses Idempotency-Key UUID; all actor identity comes from verified JWT.",
    "Five concurrent unexpired realtime connections per athlete/session; excess connects receive CONNECTION_LIMIT.",
    "Opaque invite/ticket plaintext is never persisted, including receipt results; stable HMAC secret reconstructs authorized retries."
